%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b74e3abb1658d2f47bb5a79636ec8e90, type: 3}
  m_Name: HavenHappenings
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::HavenHappenings
  spanDays: 3
  chance: 0.65
  happenings:
  - id: swarm
    placeId: haven.mother_maple.0
    needsRemembered: 1
    afterQuest: {fileID: 0}
    when: 0
    dressing: {fileID: 0}
    offset: {x: 0, y: 0}
    turn: 0
    thoughts:
    - The whole tree hums. A swarm has settled in the old maple, and the comb hangs low enough to reach.
    findName: Wild honeycomb
    findVerb: Take
    item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1dd65120c9bb0304c8a45a8012af934c, type: 2}
    amount: 3
    taken: Sticky, and stung only twice.
    findOffset: {x: 3, y: 1}
    findMarker: {fileID: 0}
    foretold: Bees have swarmed in the Mother Maple. There's honey for whoever goes.
  - id: felled-oak
    placeId: haven.woodland_camp.1
    needsRemembered: 1
    afterQuest: {fileID: 0}
    when: 0
    dressing: {fileID: 8895611290362796324, guid: 15e4a49cc87bafb4e98e809c9b1bf3f4, type: 3}
    offset: {x: 6, y: -4}
    turn: 0
    thoughts:
    - The storm brought it down across the way. Good oak, and nobody's.
    findName: Storm-felled oak
    findVerb: Cut
    item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ae2883815327b74fa7975309c803f92, type: 2}
    amount: 6
    taken: Enough for a winter's work.
    findOffset: {x: 1, y: 0}
    findMarker: {fileID: 0}
    foretold: The storm felled an oak by the Trapper's Camp in the Grey Pines.
  - id: perch-run
    placeId: haven.fisher_s_rest.0
    needsRemembered: 1
    afterQuest: {fileID: 0}
    when: 0
    dressing: {fileID: 0}
    offset: {x: 0, y: 0}
    turn: 0
    thoughts:
    - The water's boiling with perch. They've come in to the shallows.
    findName: A run of perch
    findVerb: Net
    item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1deba4cfdd0cc854ba9f9d3fa96aacd9, type: 2}
    amount: 5
    taken: Silver and quick. The basket fills.
    findOffset: {x: -3, y: -4}
    findMarker: {fileID: 0}
    foretold: The perch are running at Stillwater. The Fisher's Rest is the place.
  - id: pedlar
    placeId: haven.wayfarer_s_stones.0
    needsRemembered: 1
    afterQuest: {fileID: 0}
    when: 0
    dressing: {fileID: 8572130453576143446, guid: 5d342d69571ebf843aef467ab9afc47f, type: 3}
    offset: {x: 4, y: 3}
    turn: 0
    thoughts:
    - A pedlar on the old road, resting his feet by the stones. He's seen more of the woods than anyone at home.
    findName: What the road gave him
    findVerb: Take
    item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 74c0a8be248a5264aaf67f85d390ee8b, type: 2}
    amount: 4
    taken: '"For your fire," he says. "I''ll be gone before the next."'
    findOffset: {x: 1.5, y: -1}
    findMarker: {fileID: 0}
    foretold: A pedlar is resting at the Wayfarer's Stones, where the old road comes in.
  - id: tarn-lights
    placeId: haven.authored.tarn_shrine
    needsRemembered: 0
    afterQuest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd7dd70969be8174c8acfefd449bf963, type: 2}
    when: 2
    dressing: {fileID: 8622070203979909747, guid: 33d53f5fdf7586649bcd01d1ee8c9331, type: 3}
    offset: {x: 0, y: -3}
    turn: 0
    thoughts:
    - Cold lights over the tarn, moving the way people move. They come no closer.
    findName: 
    findVerb: Take
    item: {fileID: 0}
    amount: 1
    taken: 
    findOffset: {x: 0, y: 0}
    findMarker: {fileID: 0}
    foretold: Lights were seen over the high tarn in the night. Nobody went to look.
  - id: cloudberries
    placeId: haven.drowned_stones.0
    needsRemembered: 1
    afterQuest: {fileID: 0}
    when: 0
    dressing: {fileID: 0}
    offset: {x: 0, y: 0}
    turn: 0
    thoughts:
    - Cloudberries, amber and ripe, all over the hummocks by the drowned stones.
    findName: Ripe cloudberries
    findVerb: Pick
    item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb670a5310dbb494296de3c93180cebd, type: 2}
    amount: 6
    taken: The fen's gold. Yrsa will know what to do with these.
    findOffset: {x: 4, y: -3}
    findMarker: {fileID: 0}
    foretold: The cloudberries are ripe on the Drowning Fen.
  - id: chanterelles
    placeId: haven.authored.old_steading
    needsRemembered: 1
    afterQuest: {fileID: 0}
    when: 0
    dressing: {fileID: 0}
    offset: {x: 0, y: 0}
    turn: 0
    thoughts:
    - Chanterelles in the old yard, a ring of them, gold in the grass.
    findName: Chanterelles
    findVerb: Pick
    item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 15d1c587fc1b8f34696d9b01c733b94e, type: 2}
    amount: 5
    taken: A good handful. The old yard still feeds somebody.
    findOffset: {x: -3, y: -6}
    findMarker: {fileID: 0}
    foretold: Chanterelles have come up in the Old Steading's yard after the rain.
